{"id":8867094626503,"title":"Horse Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Vintage Animal Quilt Printed","handle":"horse-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-vintage-animal-quilt-printed","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the charm of the countryside with our Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, featuring classic patterns for a cozy, timeless look. Perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom, this quilt set offers customization options to make it uniquely yours or a thoughtful gift.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rustic elegance with a farmhouse patchwork style pattern, perfect for a cozy, timeless look.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by selecting a size, adding pillowcases, or including a custom name.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e This farmhouse quilt is available in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\").\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, ensuring quick drying and maintaining its fluffiness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e The set includes one quilt, with an option to add two pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u00